# Shell chrome — locked decisions

## AccountRailCluster placement (human decision 2026-07-06)

**`AccountRailCluster`** (bell, avatar, quick create, capture) mounts in **`AppHeader.vue` top-right** only:

```vue
<AccountRailCluster v-if="user" placement="header" />
```

**Never** mount `<AccountRailCluster>` on **`IconRail.vue`** — not on the dock end zone, not on left rail.

### Why agents keep reverting this

`docs/artifacts/campus_shell_chrome_p0b_spec.md` originally said "move cluster to dock". That goal is **cancelled**. Do not implement dock placement even if the spec body still mentions it.

### Verification

- Unit: `apps/web/app/components/layout/shell-chrome-placement.test.ts`
- E2E: `apps/web/tests/e2e/campus-dock-resident.spec.ts` (bell/avatar in **header**, not rail)
- `AGENTS.md` § Shell chrome

### Menubar vs resident

- **`AppMenubar`**: vitals, weather, clock, omnibox — ambient sky layer only
- **`AccountRailCluster`**: bell, avatar, +, capture — header right, after menubar
